- Cesari 2013 Plant Cell (RGA4/RGA5 paired-NLR; direct effector binding)
- Ortiz 2017 Plant Cell (5JHJ; AVR-Pia/RGA5-RATX1 binding surface; F24S)
- de Guillen 2015 PLoS Pathog (2MYW/2MYV; MAX fold; AVR-Pia/AVR1-CO39 NMR)
- Maqbool 2015 eLife (5A6P/5A6W; first Pik-HMA/AVR-Pik structure)
- De la Concepcion 2018 Nat Plants (6G10/6FU9; HMA interfaces 1/2/3)
- De la Concepcion 2019 eLife (6R8K/6R8M; NK-KE engineering)
- Maidment 2021 JBC (7B1I; OsHIPP19-HMA/AVR-PikF)
- Maidment 2021 PLoS Pathog (7A8W/7A8X; Pikh polymorphism)
- Maidment 2023 eLife (7QPX/7QZD; SNK-EKE engineering)
- Białas 2021 eLife (7BNT; ancestral Pik-HMA)
- Bentham 2023 Plant Cell (8B2R; engineered RGA5-HMA)
- Zdrzałek 2024 PNAS (8R7A/8R7D; Pwl2/OsHIPP43)
- Cesari 2014 EMBO J (RGA4/RGA5 paired-NLR mechanism)
